# size 20x4
# A lead byte with nothing to follow it, then a control character that draws nothing at all.
#
# The replacement still appears: it is owed the moment the next byte turns out not to belong to
# the character, and a backspace settles that debt even though it draws nothing itself. Found by
# the generator in two bytes, after the deferred-replacement rule was written for escapes only.
\xed\x08X
